# Stalwart Mail Server v1.0.2 SHA-256 checksum for stalwart-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
# Source: https://github.com/stalwartlabs/stalwart/releases/tag/v1.0.2
# Captured 2026-11-03 from the GitHub release artifact; matches the digest
# GitHub publishes for the asset.
#
# 1.0 cannot open a 0.16 data store: a 0.16 host reaches 1.0 through
# migrate_stalwart_to_v1 (Stalwart's migration tool), never through a binary
# swap. The 0.16 release the migration starts from has its own checksum file,
# install/stalwart-0.16.sha256. See ADR-0179.
#
# To capture on a version bump:
#   curl -sSL https://github.com/stalwartlabs/stalwart/releases/download/v<x.y.z>/stalwart-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz | sha256sum
# install.sh `_die`s if the placeholder PLACEHOLDER_CAPTURE_ON_FIRST_DEPLOY
# survives — matches the DokuWiki/MediaWiki tarball precedent.
